All four use the AWS4 `mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon` family with the resource-specific `resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.<service>` — the official AWS-4 icon set draw.io ships, verified against the bundled `shape-index.jsonl.gz`.

**NEEDS HUMAN POLISH** — this draft was hand-authored without rendering. Before shipping: open in app.diagrams.net to verify the icons render as expected, de-overlap any labels, confirm vendor-icon correctness, and run `drawio -x -f svg -b 10 -o foo.svg foo.drawio` to produce the committed SVG pair. House-style gaps not auto-conformed: IBM Plex Sans font (draw.io has no preset mechanism), monochrome convention (the AWS4 icons carry brand colours by design — flag in review).
